==Battleground==
*2 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Demon Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Demon Gory]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*5 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
There are two ways that you can go about this stage, either rushing or fighting the Demon Teacher Bear head on. A simple Level 50 [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] and Level 20 [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] can easily rush this stage down, just make sure you have some [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] so that the Aliens don't cause any trouble.

Though if you plan to face the Demon Teacher Bear head on, a Level 30 [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] can hold off the Demon Teacher Bear and peons well while using ranged attackers such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] who can safely stand out of Demon Teacher Bears range. [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] can also help with dealing damage despite having the exact range of Demon Teacher Bear.

